    "text": "krcrtv.com\nwebsite\nCorning\nCorning woman lights fire in front of police, officer cut with broken meth pipe\nBy Christina Candelaria,\n1 days agoCORNING, Calif. — A woman was arrested Sunday night for arson after allegedly starting a fire in front of police officers in Corning. According to the Corning Police Department (CPD), officers responded to a vegetation fire near Toomes and Blossom Avenue, just south of the skate park. The fire had already been extinguished by fire crews when they arrived.\n5",
